#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exchange posts 3"
msgstr "Centri di scambio dati 3"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect lots of valuable information from information exchange posts."
msgstr "Raccogli preziose informazioni dai centri di scambio dati."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Info"
msgstr "Info"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercice"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Several <a object|exchange>information exchange posts</a> are standing along"
" the way. When the bot is close enough to a post, it can read the "
"instructions it contains. The <a object|exchange>information exchange "
"posts</a> along the way contain the direction of the next post and the "
"distance. And you do not know how many exchange posts you must get in touch "
"with before arriving at your goal."
msgstr ""
"Lungo il percorso ci sono vari <a object|exchange>centri di scambio "
"dati</a>. Avvicinandosi abbastanza, il robot può leggere le istruzioni "
"contenute. I <a object|exchange>centri</a> indicano direzione e distanza del"
" successivo. Non sai quanti dovrai consultarne prima di arrivare."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "General principle"
msgstr "Principio generale"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve the direction from the <a object|exchange>exchange post</a>."
msgstr "Leggi la direzione dal <a object|exchange>centro di scambio dati</a>."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve the distance from the <a object|exchange>exchange post</a>."
msgstr "Leggi la distanza dal <a object|exchange>centro di scambio dati</a>."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "If no information could be retrieved, stop the program."
msgstr "Se non ricevi alcuna informazione, termina il programma."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the rotation."
msgstr "Esegui la rotazione."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move forward to the next post."
msgstr "Avanza fino al centro successivo."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Useful instructions"
msgstr "Istruzioni utili"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|while>while</a></code> to repeat the instructions\n"
"<code><a cbot|receive>receive</a></code> to get the information from a post\n"
"<code><a cbot|move>move</a></code> to move the bot\n"
"<code><a cbot|turn>turn</a></code> to turn the bot"
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|while>while</a></code> per ripetere le istruzioni\n"
"<code><a cbot|receive>receive</a></code> per leggere i dati da un centro\n"
"<code><a cbot|move>move</a></code> per spostare il robot\n"
"<code><a cbot|turn>turn</a></code> per ruotarlo"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "\tAlways repeat:"
msgstr "\tRipeti sempre:"
